From bcac27bfa83d244ff4926a3ba06f9e82f8e99697 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 09:07:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: whole starting zones, one class each; ranged
 casters/hunters; drink; loot gear-up (F-219)

- fleet: 9 areas = Elwynn (human priest), Durotar (orc warlock), Dun Morogh (dwarf paladin),
  Teldrassil (NE hunter), Tirisfal (undead mage), Mulgore (tauren druid), Eversong (BE rogue),
  Azuremyst (draenei shaman), Kezan + Lost Isles (goblin warrior); boxes = WorldMapArea bounds,
  600-min legs; AW_ZONE -> runner --zone keeps only the zone's quests (its AreaTable sub-areas +
  starting valleys + class quests) - Elwynn's box also holds Stormwind's 59 quests
- combat.kill range: casters/hunters stand off and cast, wait out their own cast bar (SPELL_START/
  GO/FAILURE for us), melee only what reaches them, go in when nothing lands for 5 s (LOS);
  abilities cast one per tick (a second only hit the GCD)
- combat.rest drinks (drink_item, drink_below_pct) and waits for mana_pct
- rotations for hunter, priest, shaman, mage, warlock, druid; caster classes count as ranged
  openers in pull planning; supplies buy water for mana classes
- gear_up() also after a fight that looted weapons/armour

